  <div class="principles" aria-label="Lab principles">
    <article>
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Built for real operations</h3>
      <p>Systems designed around actual work, constraints, and failure modes.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Legible by default</h3>
      <p>People should be able to understand, audit, and redirect the work.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>03</span>
